6-501.12 The following physical facilities were soiled in the dish room:
1. handsink basin (pink mold buildup around the drain); 
2. top of dish machine (buildup of general debris); 
3. sprayer head surface (buildup within the crevice);
4. floor along the wall behind the dish machine (general buildup of debris); and 
5. wall around the dish machine (general buildup from splash).
Clean the aforementioned items in the dish area. Physical facilities shall be cleaned as often as necessary to keep them clean.
